      "data": {
        "text": "**Choosing Invoice Extraction**\n\nI've decided to move forward with a specific OCR provider for the invoice extraction task and am making it explicitly identifiable within the Python script I'm building. Given the fields like vendor, date, total, and line items, I think an OCR approach is the most suitable, given the typical format.\n\n\n**Implementing Document AI**\n\nI am now structuring the `extract_invoice_fields.py` file. I've included the necessary imports for Google Cloud Document AI. The `extract_invoice_fields` function is taking shape, designed to accept an invoice file path. Inside, I'll initialize the Document AI client and craft the processor name with placeholders for project details, given the current lack of active credentials or a deployed processor. The code will read the invoice and construct a `document_ai.RawDocument` object, followed by a call to the `process_document` method, the core of the extraction process.\n\n\n",
